      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the resistance thing but i'm not being reckless, i'll just finish the whole bottle if i start it. i'm pretty sure it's bacterial because my throat is super red and my glands are swollen. i really don't want to deal with a doctor's office just for a sore throat. if i take like 500mg every 8 hours since that's what i was on before, is that a safe way to just get through this?",
